{"description": "What You’ll Do<br><br><div><p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Role Summary</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335559738\":160,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Avalara is seeking a Senior Security Engineer to join our Platform Security team. As Avalara continues to expand its global SaaS platform, cloud footprint, and engineering velocity, we&nbsp;require&nbsp;scalable security capabilities that are embedded directly into how software and infrastructure are built and&nbsp;operated.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">This role exists to design, implement, and deploy platform-wide security tooling and controls that deliver secure-by-design principles across CI/CD workflows, cloud infrastructure, and runtime compute environments. The successful candidate will collaborate with Product Engineering, Core Services, and Security teams to automate security controls, reduce risk, and improve the security posture of Avalara&rsquo;s SaaS platform at scale.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">This role is ideal for an engineer who combines deep technical&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in cloud and infrastructure security with a strong&nbsp;track record&nbsp;of technical execution, automation, and cross-functional influence. This position reports to the Senior Manager of Platform Security.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">How This Role Elevates Avalara</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335559738\":160,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">This role will:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Improve the security posture of Avalara&rsquo;s cloud platforms through scalable security controls and automation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Reduce infrastructure, CI/CD, and runtime risk by implementing secure-by-default guardrails and engineering best practices.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Increase engineering velocity by embedding security into development workflows and enabling teams to build securely at scale.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Strengthen platform observability, threat detection, and response capabilities across cloud environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Advance Avalara&rsquo;s AI-first strategy by&nbsp;identifying&nbsp;opportunities to responsibly&nbsp;leverage&nbsp;AI within platform security operations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Raise security awareness and capability across engineering teams through technical leadership, collaboration, and mentorship.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div> <br>What Your Responsibilities Will Be<br><br><div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">The successful candidate will:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Engineer and deliver secure-by-default platform components and shared security services, including authentication, secrets management, encryption, and access control capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive adoption of zero-trust principles, least-privilege access models, and scalable security guardrails across infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, and runtime environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Improve platform-wide security posture through enhanced observability, threat detection, security automation, and engineering enablement.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide&nbsp;technical guidance to engineering teams on threat&nbsp;modeling, secure design practices, and software development lifecycle security controls.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div></div><div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Lead complex, cross-functional security initiatives with clear milestones, measurable outcomes, and risk reduction&nbsp;objectives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop and execute remediation strategies that address security findings and improve organizational security maturity.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate with engineering teams to embed security into cloud-native architectures, deployment pipelines, and operational processes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify&nbsp;opportunities to&nbsp;leverage&nbsp;AI and automation to strengthen platform security capabilities and operational effectiveness.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">12-Month Success Signals</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335559738\":160,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Within the first 12 months, this engineer will:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Deliver platform-wide security capabilities that measurably reduce cloud, infrastructure, and CI/CD risk.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Improve adoption of secure-by-default engineering practices across multiple development teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Increase visibility into security posture through enhanced monitoring, detection, and reporting capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Successfully lead complex remediation and security improvement initiatives involving multiple stakeholder groups.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Establish scalable security controls that improve developer experience while&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;strong security standards.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrate measurable improvements in platform security effectiveness through automation, risk reduction, and operational efficiency.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Contribute to the adoption of AI-enabled security capabilities that improve detection, analysis, or response effectiveness.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\"><span da