ks and opportunities and provide guidance on responsible adoption.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Use AI to improve the efficiency, accuracy, and scalability of platform security processes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p><span xml:lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrate measurable improvements in security outcomes through AI-enabled capabilities and automation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335559738\":0,\"335559739\":0}\">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div></div><div><div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\"><li role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{\"335552541\":1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769226\":\"Symbol\",\"469769242\":[8226],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-lev